<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lockheed cut near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lockheed cut near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on Lockheed Martin Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 92-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
